<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
  <title>Réinitialisation de votre mot de passe — MindAura</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    /* ── Reset ── */
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; display: block; }

    /* ── Base ── */
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #EAEFE9;
      color: #1A1A2E;
    }

    /* ── Wrapper ── */
    .email-wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #EAEFE9; padding: 40px 16px; }
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(27,67,50,0.15); }

    /* ── Header ── */
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0D3320 0%, #1B5E38 55%, #2D7A50 100%);
      padding: 52px 48px 44px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: -60px; right: -60px;
      width: 220px; height: 220px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    .header::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; bottom: -80px; left: -40px;
      width: 180px; height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }
    .header-icon-wrap {
      width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: 0 auto 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 36px; line-height: 80px; text-align: center;
    }
    .header-brand {
      font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    }
    .header-tagline {
      font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ── Gradient bar ── */
    .gradient-bar {
      height: 5px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #52B788 0%, #95D5B2 40%, #7B5EA7 80%, #B5A4D4 100%);
    }

    /* ── Body ── */
    .email-body {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 52px 48px 44px;
    }

    /* ── Subject line ── */
    .subject-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #EBF7F0; color: #1B5E38;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 14px; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* ── Greeting ── */
    .greeting {
      font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #0D1F15;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .intro-text {
      font-size: 15px; color: #5A6475; line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    /* ── Timer card ── */
    .timer-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EBF7F0 0%, #D8F0E6 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid #B7E4CC;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    }
    .timer-icon { font-size: 28px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .timer-text { font-size: 14px; color: #1B5E38; line-height: 1.6; }
    .timer-text strong { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #0D3320; }

    /* ── Timer bar ── */
    .timer-bar-wrap { margin-top: 10px; }
    .timer-bar-track {
      height: 6px; background: rgba(27,94,56,0.15); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .timer-bar-fill {
      height: 100%; width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2D7A50, #52B788);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    .timer-bar-label { font-size: 11px; color: #52B788; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 5px; text-align: right; }

    /* ── CTA ── */
    .cta-wrap { text-align: center; margin: 40px 0 36px; }
    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B5E38 0%, #2D7A50 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF !important; text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      padding: 20px 60px; border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(27,94,56,0.38), 0 4px 12px rgba(27,94,56,0.2);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      transition: transform 0.15s;
    }

    /* ── Divider ── */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #E0E7EA 20%, #E0E7EA 80%, transparent);
      margin: 36px 0;
    }

    /* ── Steps ── */
    .steps-label {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: #A0AAB8; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .step-row {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px;
      padding: 14px 0;
    }
    .step-row + .step-row { border-top: 1px solid #F0F4F8; }
    .step-num {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B5E38, #2D7A50);
      color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center; line-height: 32px;
    }
    .step-body { padding-top: 5px; }
    .step-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A1A2E; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .step-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #8A95A3; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* ── Security box ── */
    .security-box {
      background: #FFF8F0;
      border: 1.5px solid #FFD9A8;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin: 36px 0 28px;
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .security-icon { font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .security-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #7A4500; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .security-text { font-size: 13px; color: #9A6520; line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ── Fallback URL ── */
    .fallback-wrap {
      background: #F5F7FA; border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px 22px; margin-top: 4px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .fallback-text { font-size: 13px; color: #8A95A3; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .fallback-url {
      font-size: 12px; color: #7B5EA7;
      word-break: break-all; text-decoration: none;
      font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .footer {
      background: #F0F4F8;
      padding: 32px 48px 36px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #1B5E38; font-family: Georgia, serif; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .footer-desc { font-size: 12px; color: #8A95A3; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .footer-divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #DDE2E7; margin: 16px auto; width: 60%; }
    .footer-links { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .footer-link { font-size: 12px; color: #7B5EA7; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 11px; color: #B0BAC8; }

    /* ── Responsive ── */
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .header, .email-body, .footer { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }
      .cta-btn { padding: 18px 36px !important; font-size: 16px !important; }
      .header { padding-top: 40px !important; padding-bottom: 32px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="email-wrapper">
  <table class="email-container" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(27,67,50,0.15);">
    <tr>
      <td>

        <!-- ══ HEADER ══ -->
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="header" style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0D3320 0%,#1B5E38 55%,#2D7A50 100%);padding:52px 48px 44px;text-align:center;">
              <!-- Icon circle -->
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 auto 20px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="width:80px;height:80px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;font-size:36px;">
                    🔐
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <div style="font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">MindAura</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;">Psychologie &amp; Développement Personnel</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <!-- Gradient bar -->
          <tr>
            <td style="height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#52B788 0%,#95D5B2 40%,#7B5EA7 80%,#B5A4D4 100%);"></td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- ══ BODY ══ -->
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="email-body" style="background:#FFFFFF;padding:52px 48px 44px;">

              <!-- Badge -->
              <div>
                <span style="display:inline-block;background:#EBF7F0;color:#1B5E38;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 14px;margin-bottom:24px;">
                  Réinitialisation du mot de passe
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Greeting -->
              <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0D1F15;font-family:Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.3;">
                Bonjour {{ user.prenomUtilisateur }} 👋
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:15px;color:#5A6475;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:36px;">
                Nous avons reçu une demande de réinitialisation du mot de passe pour votre compte MindAura associé à <strong style="color:#1A1A2E;">{{ user.emailUtilisateur }}</strong>.<br/><br/>
                Si vous êtes à l'origine de cette demande, cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour créer un nouveau mot de passe sécurisé.
              </div>

              <!-- Timer card -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EBF7F0 0%,#D8F0E6 100%);border:1.5px solid #B7E4CC;border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;">
                    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width:40px;font-size:28px;vertical-align:middle;">⏱️</td>
                        <td style="padding-left:14px;">
                          <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#0D3320;margin-bottom:4px;">Lien valable {{ ttl }} minutes</div>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#2D7A50;line-height:1.5;">Ce lien expirera automatiquement après {{ ttl }} minutes. Passé ce délai, vous devrez effectuer une nouvelle demande.</div>
                          <!-- Progress bar -->
                          <div style="margin-top:12px;">
                            <div style="height:6px;background:rgba(27,94,56,0.15);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">
                              <div style="height:100%;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2D7A50,#52B788);border-radius:10px;"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="font-size:11px;color:#52B788;font-weight:600;margin-top:5px;text-align:right;">100 % restant</div>
                          </div>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- CTA Button -->
              <div style="text-align:center;margin:40px 0 36px;">
                <a href="{{ resetUrl }}" target="_blank"
                   style="display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B5E38 0%,#2D7A50 100%);color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.3px;padding:20px 60px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(27,94,56,0.38),0 4px 12px rgba(27,94,56,0.2);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;">
                  🔑 &nbsp; Réinitialiser mon mot de passe
                </a>
              </div>

              <!-- Divider -->
              <div style="border:none;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#E0E7EA 20%,#E0E7EA 80%,transparent);margin:36px 0;"></div>

              <!-- Steps -->
              <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#A0AAB8;margin-bottom:20px;">Comment ça marche ?</div>

              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F0F4F8;">
                    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width:32px;height:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B5E38,#2D7A50);border-radius:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                          <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:32px;">1</span>
                        </td>
                        <td style="width:16px;"></td>
                        <td>
                          <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A2E;margin-bottom:3px;">Cliquez sur le bouton</div>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8A95A3;line-height:1.5;">Ou copiez le lien de réinitialisation directement dans votre navigateur.</div>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F0F4F8;">
                    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width:32px;height:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B5E38,#2D7A50);border-radius:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                          <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:32px;">2</span>
                        </td>
                        <td style="width:16px;"></td>
                        <td>
                          <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A2E;margin-bottom:3px;">Choisissez un nouveau mot de passe</div>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8A95A3;line-height:1.5;">Au moins <strong style="color:#1A1A2E;">8 caractères</strong>, une <strong style="color:#1A1A2E;">majuscule</strong> et un <strong style="color:#1A1A2E;">chiffre</strong> requis.</div>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:14px 0;">
                    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width:32px;height:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B5E38,#2D7A50);border-radius:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                          <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:32px;">3</span>
                        </td>
                        <td style="width:16px;"></td>
                        <td>
                          <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A2E;margin-bottom:3px;">Reconnectez-vous</div>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8A95A3;line-height:1.5;">Utilisez votre nouveau mot de passe pour accéder à votre espace MindAura.</div>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Security notice -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background:#FFF8F0;border:1.5px solid #FFD9A8;border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;">
                    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="font-size:22px;vertical-align:top;padding-right:14px;padding-top:2px;">⚠️</td>
                        <td>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#7A4500;margin-bottom:6px;">Vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande ?</div>
                          <div style="font-size:13px;color:#9A6520;line-height:1.65;">
                            <strong>Ignorez simplement cet e-mail</strong> — votre mot de passe actuel restera inchangé et votre compte n'est pas compromis. Pour votre sécurité, ne partagez jamais ce lien avec une autre personne.
                          </div>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Fallback URL -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background:#F5F7FA;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8A95A3;margin-bottom:10px;">Le bouton ne fonctionne pas ? Copiez ce lien dans votre navigateur :</div>
                    <a href="{{ resetUrl }}" style="font-size:12px;color:#7B5EA7;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:none;font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;" target="_blank">
                      {{ resetUrl }}
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- ══ FOOTER ══ -->
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#F0F4F8;padding:32px 48px 36px;text-align:center;">

              <!-- Separator dots -->
              <div style="font-size:16px;color:#C8D0DA;letter-spacing:6px;margin-bottom:16px;">· · ·</div>

              <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B5E38;font-family:Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:6px;">🧠 MindAura</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:#8A95A3;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:16px;">
                Votre espace dédié au bien-être mental et au développement personnel.<br/>
                Cet e-mail a été envoyé à <strong style="color:#5A6475;">{{ user.emailUtilisateur }}</strong>.
              </div>

              <div style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #DDE2E7;margin:16px auto;width:60%;"></div>

              <div style="margin-bottom:14px;">
                <a href="#" style="font-size:12px;color:#7B5EA7;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;">Politique de confidentialité</a>
                <a href="#" style="font-size:12px;color:#7B5EA7;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;">Conditions d'utilisation</a>
                <a href="#" style="font-size:12px;color:#7B5EA7;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;">Nous contacter</a>
              </div>

              <div style="font-size:11px;color:#B0BAC8;">
                &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} MindAura — Tous droits réservés. Cet e-mail est automatique, merci de ne pas y répondre.
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>
